  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA substantial 1,146m² site in a sought-after location, offering a wide street frontage, a legal home and income, and potential sea views.\r\n\r\nThe main home offers 3 bedrooms, a modern bathroom and kitchen, and a double garage with extra storage space. Classic weatherboard construction, tongue-and-groove flooring and an easy flow to decks and garden spaces. \r\n\r\nThe one-bedroom income flat provides flexibility for extended family or additional income.\r\n\r\nFabulous location - easy walk to the beach and shops, a stroll to Mairangi Bay Primary School, also zoned for Rangitoto College and Westlake Girls' High School.\r\n\r\nLarge land, a versatile legal home and income, and a position that rarely comes to market - this is an opportunity worth exploring.",
